3 Kings	3Ki	11	18	13	Hath it not been told thee, my lord, what I did when Jezabel killed the prophets of the Lord, how I hid a hundred men of the prophets of the Lord, by fifty and fifty in caves, and fed them with bread and water?
3 Kings	3Ki	11	18	14	And now thou sayest: Go, and tell thy master: Elias is here: that he may kill me.
