3 Kings	3Ki	11	18	34	And he said: Fill four buckets with water, and pour it upon the burnt offering, and upon the wood. And again he said: Do the same the second time. And when they had done it the second time, he said: Do the same also the third time. And they did so the third time.
3 Kings	3Ki	11	18	35	And the water run round about the altar, and the trench was filled with water.
