3 Kings	3Ki	11	20	3	He said: Thus saith Benadad: Thy silver, and thy gold is mine: and thy wives, and thy goodliest children are mine.
3 Kings	3Ki	11	20	4	And the king of Israel answered: According to thy word, my lord O king, I am thine, and all that I have.
3 Kings	3Ki	11	20	5	And the messengers came again, and said: Thus saith Benadad, who sent us unto thee: Thy silver, and thy gold, and thy wives, and thy children thou shalt deliver up to me.
