1 Paralipomena	1Par	13	22	5	And David said: Solomon my son is very young and tender, and the house which I would have to be built to the Lord, must be such as to be renowned in all countries: therefore I will prepare him necessaries. And therefore before his death he prepared all the charges.
1 Paralipomena	1Par	13	22	6	And he called for Solomon his son: and commanded him to build a house to the Lord the God of Israel.
1 Paralipomena	1Par	13	22	7	And David said to Solomon: My son, it was my desire to have built a house to the name of the Lord my God.
1 Paralipomena	1Par	13	22	8	But the word of the Lord came to me, saying: Thou hast shed much blood, and fought many battles, so thou canst not build a house to my name, after shedding so much blood before me:
1 Paralipomena	1Par	13	22	9	The son, that shall be born to thee, shall be a most quiet man: for I will make him rest from all his enemies round about: and therefore he shall be called Peaceable: and I will give peace and quietness to Israel all his days.
1 Paralipomena	1Par	13	22	10	He shall build a house to my name, and he shall be a son to me, and I will be a father to him: and I will establish the throne of his kingdom over Israel for ever.
1 Paralipomena	1Par	13	22	11	Now then, my son, the Lord be with thee, and do thou prosper, and build the house to the Lord thy God, as he hath spoken of thee.
