1 Paralipomena	1Par	13	26	1	And the divisions of the porters: of the Corites Meselemia, the son of Core, of the sons of Asaph.
1 Paralipomena	1Par	13	26	2	The sons of Meselemia: Zacharias the firstborn, Jadihel the second, Zabadias the third, Jathanael the fourth,
1 Paralipomena	1Par	13	26	3	Elam the fifth, Johanan the sixth, Elioenai the seventh.
1 Paralipomena	1Par	13	26	4	And the sons of Obededom, Semeias the firstborn, Jozabad the second, Joaha the third, Sachar the fourth, Nathanael the fifth,
1 Paralipomena	1Par	13	26	5	Ammiel the sixth, Issachar the seventh, Phollathi the eighth: for the Lord had blessed him.
