1 Paralipomena	1Par	13	27	18	Over Juda, Eliu the brother of David: over Issachar, Amri the son of Michael:
1 Paralipomena	1Par	13	27	19	Over the Zabulonites, Jesmaias the son of Adias: over the Nephtalites, Jerimoth the son of Ozriel:
1 Paralipomena	1Par	13	27	20	Over the sons of Ephraim, Osee the: son of Ozaziu: over the half tribe of Manasses, Joel the son of Phadaia:
1 Paralipomena	1Par	13	27	21	And over the half tribe of Manasses: in Galaad, Jaddo the son of Zacharias: and over Benjamin, Jasiel the son of Abner.
1 Paralipomena	1Par	13	27	22	And over Dan, Ezrihel the son of Jeroham: these were the princes of the children of Israel.
