2 Paralipomena	2Par	14	1	7	And behold that night God appeared to him, saying: Ask what thou wilt that I should give thee.
2 Paralipomena	2Par	14	1	8	And Solomon said to God: Thou hast shewn great kindness to my father David: and hast made me king in his stead.
2 Paralipomena	2Par	14	1	9	Now therefore, O Lord God, let thy word be fulfilled, which thou hast promised to David my father: for thou hast made me king over thy great people, which is as innumerable as the dust of the earth.
