2 Paralipomena	2Par	14	3	1	And Solomon began to build the house of the Lord in Jerusalem, in mount Moria, which had been shewn to David his father, in the place which David had prepared in the threshingfloor of Ornan the Jebusite.
2 Paralipomena	2Par	14	3	2	And he began to build in the second month, in the fourth year of his reign.
2 Paralipomena	2Par	14	3	3	Now these are the foundations, which Solomon laid, to build the house of God, the length by the first measure sixty cubits, the breadth twenty cubits.
2 Paralipomena	2Par	14	3	4	And the porch in the front, which was extended in length according to the measure of the breadth of the house, twenty cubits: and the height was a hundred and twenty cubits: and he overlaid it within with pure gold.
