2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	16	Adonia, Begoai, Adin,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	17	Ater, Hezecia, Azur,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	18	Odaia, Hasum, Besai,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	19	Hareph, Anathoth, Nebai,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	20	Megphias, Mosollam, Hazir,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	21	Mesizabel, Sadoc, Jeddua,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	22	Pheltia, Hanan, Anaia,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	23	Osee, Hanania, Hasub,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	24	Alohes, Phalea, Sobec,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	25	Rehum, Hasebna, Maasia,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	26	Echaia, Hanan, Anan,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	27	Melluch, Haran, Baana:
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	28	And the rest of the people, priests, Levites, porters, and singing men, Nathinites, and all that had separated themselves from the people of the lands to the law of God, their wives, their sons, and their daughters.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	29	All that could understand promising for their brethren, with their chief men, and they came to promise, and swear that they would walk in the law of God, which he gave in the hand of Moses the servant of God, that they would do and keep all the commandments of the Lord our God, and his judgments and his ceremonies.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	30	And that we would not give our daughters to the people of the land, not take their daughters for our sons.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	31	And if the people of the land bring in things to sell, or any things for use, to sell them on the sabbath day, that we would not buy them of them on the sabbath, or on the holy day. And that we would leave the seventh year, and the exaction of every hand.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	32	And we made ordinances for ourselves, to give the third part of a side every year for the work of the house of our God,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	33	For the loaves of proposition, and for the continual sacrifice, and for a continual holocaust on the sabbaths, on the new moons, on the set feasts, and for the holy things, and for the sin offering: that atonement might be made for Israel, and for every use of the house of our God.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	34	And we cast lots among the priests, and the Levites, and the people for the offering of wood, that it might be brought into the house of our God by the houses of our fathers at set times, from year to year: to burn upon the altar of the Lord our God, as it is written in the law of Moses:
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	35	And that we would bring the first fruits of our land, and the firstfruits of all fruit of every tree, from year to year, in the house of our Lord.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	36	And the firstborn of our sons, and of our cattle, as it is written in the law, and the firstlings of our oxen, and of our sheep, to be offered in the house of our God, to the priests who minister in the house of our God.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	37	And that we would bring the firstfruits of our meats, and of our libations, and the fruit of every tree, of the vintage also and of oil to the priests, to the storehouse of our God, and the tithes of our ground to the Levites. The Levites also shall receive the tithes of our works out of all the cities.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	38	And the priest the son of Aaron shall be with the Levites in the tithes of the Levites, and the Levites shall offer the tithe of their tithes in the house of our God, to the storeroom into the treasure house.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	10	39	For the children of Israel and the children of Levi shall carry to the treasury the firstfruits of corn, of wine, and of oil: and the sanctified vessels shall be there, and the priests, and the singing men, and the porters, and ministers, and we will not forsake the house of our God.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	1	And the princes of the people dwelt at Jerusalem: but the rest of the people cast lots, to take one part in ten to dwell in Jerusalem the holy city, and nine parts in the other cities.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	2	And the people blessed all the men that willingly offered themselves to dwell in Jerusalem.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	3	These therefore are the chief men of the province, who dwelt in Jerusalem, and in the cities of Juda. And every one dwelt in his possession, in their cities: Israel, the priests, the Levites, the Nathinites, and the children of the servants of Solomon.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	4	And in Jerusalem there dwelt some of the children of Juda, and some of the children of Benjamin: of the children of Juda, Athaias the son of Aziam, the son of Zacharias, the son of Amarias, the son of Saphatias, the son of Malaleel: of the sons of Phares,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	5	Maasia the son of Baruch, the son of Cholhoza, the son of Hazia, the son of Adaia, the son of Joiarib, the son of Zacharias, the son of the Silonite:
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	6	All these the sons of Phares, who dwelt in Jerusalem, were four hundred sixty-eight valiant men.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	7	And these are the children of Benjamin: Sellum the son of Mosollam, the son of Joed, the son of Phadaia, the son of Colaia, the son of Masia, the son of Etheel, the son of Isaia.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	8	And after him Gebbai, Sellai, nine hundred twenty-eight.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	9	And Joel the son of Zechri their ruler, and Judas the son of Senua was second over the city.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	10	And of the priests Idaia the son of Joarib, Jachin,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	11	Saraia the son of Helcias, the son of Mosollam, the son of Sadoc, the son of Meraioth, the son of Achitob the prince of the house of God,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	12	And their brethren that do the works of the temple: eight hundred twenty-two. And Adaia the son of Jeroham, the son of Phelelia, the son of Amsi, the son of Zacharias, the son of Pheshur, the son of Melchias,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	13	And his brethren the chiefs of the fathers: two hundred forty-two. And Amassai the son of Azreel, the son of Ahazi, the son of Mosollamoth, the son of Emmer,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	14	And their brethren who were very mighty, a hundred twenty-eight: and their ruler Zabdiel son of the mighty.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	15	And of the Levites Semeia the son of Hasub, the son of Azaricam, the son of Hasabia, the son of Boni,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	16	And Sabathai and Jozabed, who were over all the outward business of the house of God, of the princes of the Levites,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	17	And Mathania the son of Micha, the son of Zebedei, the son of Asaph, was the principal man to praise, and to give glory in prayer, and Becbecia the second, one of his brethren, and Abda the son of Samua, the son of Galal, the son of Idithun.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	18	All the Levites in the holy city were two hundred eighty-four.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	19	And the porters, Accub, Telmon, and their brethren, who kept the doors: a hundred seventy-two.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	20	And the rest of Israel, the priests and the Levites were in all the cities of Juda, every man in his possession.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	21	And the Nathinites, that dwelt in Ophel, and Siaha, and Gaspha of the Nathinites.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	22	And the overseer of the Levites in Jerusalem, was Azzi the son of Bani, the son of Hasabia, the son of Mathania, the son of Micha. Of the sons of Asaph, were the singing men in the ministry of the house of God.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	23	For the king's commandment was concerning them, and an order among the singing men day by day.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	24	And Phathahia the son of Mesezebel of the children of Zara the son of Juda was at the hand of the king, in all matters concerning the people,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	25	And in the houses through all their countries. Of the children of Juda so dwelt at Cariath-Arbe, and in the villages thereof: and at Dibon, and in the villages thereof: and at Cabseel, and in the villages thereof.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	26	And at Jesue, and at Molada, and Bethphaleth,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	27	And at Hasersual, and at Bersabee, and in the villages thereof,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	28	And at Siceleg, and at Mochona, and in the villages thereof,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	29	And at Remmon, and at Saraa, and at Jerimuth,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	30	Zanoa, Odollam, and in their villages, at Lachis and its dependencies, and at Azeca and the villages thereof. And they dwelt from Bersabee unto the valley of Ennom.
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	31	And the children of Benjamin, from Geba, at Mechmas, and at Hai, and at Bethel, and in the villages thereof,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	32	At Anathoth, Nob, Anania,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	33	Asor, Rama, Gethaim,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	34	Hadid, Seboim, and Neballat, Led,
2 Esdras	Neh	16	11	35	And Ono the valley of craftsmen.
