Esther	Est	19	3	8	And Aman said to king Assuerus: There is a people scattered through all the provinces of thy kingdom, and separated one from another, that use new laws and ceremonies, and moreover despise the king's ordinances: and thou knowest very well that it is not expedient for thy kingdom that they should grow insolent by impunity.
Esther	Est	19	3	9	If it please thee, decree that they may he destroyed, and I will pay ten thousand talents to thy treasurers.
